# Query a TypeScript project
Open the project with `openCorsaApiFrontend` from `@mizchi/uneffect/corsa/api` and use the returned frontend for symbol queries.
For a checker fact export, use `exportCorsaCheckerFacts` from `@mizchi/uneffect/experimental/corsa`.

Reviewed import paths and their exports (other paths were not inspected):
@mizchi/uneffect/corsa/api: openCorsaApiFrontend
@mizchi/uneffect/experimental/corsa: exportCorsaCheckerFacts

Provider lookup for explicit names and paths in the guide:
Every checked name is listed at its documented provider.
openCorsaApiFrontend from @mizchi/uneffect/corsa/api: exported here
exportCorsaCheckerFacts from @mizchi/uneffect/experimental/corsa: exported here
